Children are walked in declaration order, not sorted order: the tree declares z, a, m and
the receipt reports them in that order.

-- fixtures/xdg/booping/config.yaml --
core:
  e2e_demo:
    tree:
      z.txt: "z\n"
      a.txt: "a\n"
      m.txt: "m\n"
-- cmd --
booping scaffold core.e2e_demo.tree .
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- /dev/null
+++ z.txt
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+z
--- /dev/null
+++ a.txt
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+a
--- /dev/null
+++ m.txt
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+m
scaffolded 3 paths — 0 dirs created, 3 files created, 0 files overwritten
